            "detailed_description": "Once again, you only have to draw one continuous line. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhen you draw on a tile, it will change color from orange to blue or from blue to orange. You solve each puzzle, by making all tiles akin. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere are 96 puzzles on &quot;Normal&quot;-mode and 96 puzzles in &quot;Time&quot;-mode. Each puzzles can have many different solutions. Start with basic puzzles and unlock harder ones. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere are also special tiles. The &quot;Teleport&quot;-tile, teleports the line to another point in the puzzle. The &quot;Double Use&quot;-tile can be used twice, which is requires to solve some of the puzzles",
            "about_the_game": "Once again, you only have to draw one continuous line. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhen you draw on a tile, it will change color from orange to blue or from blue to orange. You solve each puzzle, by making all tiles akin. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere are 96 puzzles on &quot;Normal&quot;-mode and 96 puzzles in &quot;Time&quot;-mode. Each puzzles can have many different solutions. Start with basic puzzles and unlock harder ones. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere are also special tiles. The &quot;Teleport&quot;-tile, teleports the line to another point in the puzzle. The &quot;Double Use&quot;-tile can be used twice, which is requires to solve some of the puzzles",
